- CRM RBAC hardened — permissions enforced on views, relations, and record actions
- Cross-workspace CRM record viewing and management for shared databases
- CRM standalone database creation now defaults to the correct context
- Task project routing and RBAC checks resolved
- Optimized CRM record creation with smarter cache updates
- Chat: fixed date separator stacking on long message threads
